    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 13th level, you can use your reaction when you take damage from an attack or spell to step into the shadows, giving you immunity to all damage until the end of the next turn, including the triggering attack.</p><p>You can use this feature twice. You regain expended uses when you finish a short or long rest.</p>",
